# The upload signing key and anything stored beside it. The .jks itself is
# already covered, but the whole folder is excluded so that a keystore.properties
# holding the store/key passwords can never be added here by accident. Losing
# this key means never being able to update the app on Play; leaking it means
# someone else can sign updates as you. Back it up outside git.
HouseOfKiran-signing/
